_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T22:00:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T22:20:21Z","body":"Shouldn't the tab get renamed to AssetStore?\r\nAlso it would be nice if clicking asset screenshot opened a bigger version (in a popup or something). The current previews don't show full size.\r\nAlso also there needs to be some button that opens AssetStore page. They usually have more detailed description than what is presented in the editor. (although not sure what are the plans exactly here; will the markdown descriptions be eventually in the editor?)\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nThe filter menu options are not functional:\r\n```\r\nERROR: Error calling from signal 'item_selected' to callable: 'EditorAssetLibrary::EditorAssetLibrary::_search': Method expected 1 argument(s), but called with 2.   at: Object::emit_signalp (C:\\godot_source\\core/object/object.cpp:1354)\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587375956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587576903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112992#issuecomment-3587576903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112992","id":3587576903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V1hRH","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev",