/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T03:37:02Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T03:46:46Z","body":"> Why wouldn't it? The description and images are the same no matter which version is selected, that would just add an extra step to download it.\r\n\r\nidk, it's just unexpected. Nothing indicates that selecting the version will start download. Also, since it's a dropdown menu, you can missclick and it will start downloading wrong version. Feels weird.\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nFrom further testing:\r\n- Clicking asset's author will open their store page. Could it instead filter assets by author? (though it would be nice to keep the link in some form)\r\n- There is no list of available tags, if you want to filter by tags you have to either guess or find them in some assets.\r\n- What is the \"Licenses\" button (?) supposed to do?\r\n<img width=\"316\" height=\"166\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/677affa0-17ba-429e-ac82-00e1dabdb15c\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677330458/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677653068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112992#issuecomment-3677653068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112992","id":3677653068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bNIhM","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T09:36:18Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T09:36:18Z","body":"> Why wouldn't it? The description and images are the same no matter which version is selected, that would just add an extra step to download it.\r\n\r\nIs it obvious that the \"description and images are the same no matter which version is selected\" for a user of the more conventional software that it would immediately start the download and close the window you are currently interested in even when you have the \"download\" button at the bottom? I don't think I've ever seen any software download anything when you're just browsing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677653068/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng