utton is not that.\r\n\r\n> Changelog feature was recently added to the Asset store. It is currently not visible in Asset page inside Editor.\r\n\r\nThere's no API to fetch that as far as I'm aware.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3819846276/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3991855967","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112992#issuecomment-3991855967","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112992","id":3991855967,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7t7uNf","user":{"login":"winston-yallow","id":44872771,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODcyNzcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44872771?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow","html_url":"https://github.com/winston-yallow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/winston-yallow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-03T15:36:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T15:36:54Z","body":"As for fetching the changelog from the website: I went ahead and implemented this as it's super simple to expose. It's not yet deployed, but the new API endpoint will look like this and become available with the next deployment!\r\n\r\n<img width=\"595\" height=\"578\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ff69100-7c3e-4919-90a6-0e4b48eac168\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3991855967/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4227941151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112992#issuecomment-4227941151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112992","id":4227941151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78AUMf","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-11T02:41:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T02:41:42Z","body":"The PR has been updated, adding changelog for assets, and making use of the new maximum `Control` size feature in relevant areas.","a